{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience the first few hours of \u201cBakery Cafe Simulator\u201d solo or with up to 4 players online.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this prologue you'll find <strong>10 recipes</strong> to cook for your customers, including various coffee recipes and a few pastries such as cookies and cakes. <strong>Thirty or so customization elements</strong> for your store will also be available, allowing you to let your imagination run wild as you personalize your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/Gif_01.gif?t=1745586742\" />Build and furnish your caf\u00e9 according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/Gif_02.gif?t=1745586742\" />Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/Gif_03_V2.gif?t=1745586742\" />Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669720?t=1745586742","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3669720?t=1745586742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/3161a90b9f580b42724e2dbbfede9c94d8733500/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745586742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/3161a90b9f580b42724e